@startuml
!include _style.iuml
' Adapted from reviewed presentation sources: W2-delivery-ledgers, W3-07a; separate SQL commit / relay / consumer
skinparam dpi 110
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 17
skinparam ClassStereotypeFontSize 15
skinparam NoteFontSize 16
skinparam LegendFontSize 15
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 165
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 24
hide footbox
hide circle
title DP-2 · acceptance survives but the command is lost
autonumber
actor Client
participant "Media acceptance\n(candidate)" as M
database "Media database" as DB
queue "Broker" as Q
Client -> M : finalize verified source
M -> DB : commit accepted asset
DB --> M : committed
alt crash before publish or broker unavailable
 M -> M : publication cannot complete
 note over DB,Q : Asset exists; no durable command to repair.\nProcessing never receives this accepted work.
else send succeeds, reply is lost
 M -> Q : publish command
 Q --> M : timeout / uncertain reply
 Client -> M : retry request
 note over M,Q : Without durable request / inbox identity,\nreplay can create duplicate work.
end
@enduml
